title: ShopWine
---
// Talk target of the wine shelf in the corner shop (Hotspots layer). See shop_door.yarn.
// She named her wine in her text on the first Thursday; holding it is a gate of the
// second Thursday.
-> Look
    You: Red Fox, the 2021. The one she drinks.
    You: Next to it the Reserve. Same fox, gold label. And a house red with a price sticker on the front.
-> Take the Red Fox 2021 <<if $chapter == "R1Thu2" and $gate_r1_thu2_text and not $gate_r1_thu2_door and not $item_wine_fox>>
    <<if $item_wine_reserve or $item_wine_house>>
        You: I put the other one back.
    <<endif>>
    <<set $item_wine_reserve to false>>
    <<set $item_wine_house to false>>
    <<set $item_wine_fox to true>>
    <<set $gate_r1_thu2_wine to true>>
    <<done R1Dinner2 which>>
    <<done R1Dinner2 fox>>
    <<note_done r1_wine>>
    <<note r1_thu2 "Red Fox 2021 in hand. Her door, eight.">>
-> Take the Red Fox Reserve <<if $chapter == "R1Thu2" and $gate_r1_thu2_text and not $gate_r1_thu2_door and not $item_wine_reserve>>
    <<if $item_wine_fox or $item_wine_house>>
        You: I put the other one back.
    <<endif>>
    <<set $item_wine_fox to false>>
    <<set $item_wine_house to false>>
    <<set $item_wine_reserve to true>>
-> Take the house red <<if $chapter == "R1Thu2" and $gate_r1_thu2_text and not $gate_r1_thu2_door and not $item_wine_house>>
    <<if $item_wine_fox or $item_wine_reserve>>
        You: I put the other one back.
    <<endif>>
    <<set $item_wine_fox to false>>
    <<set $item_wine_reserve to false>>
    <<set $item_wine_house to true>>
===
